{"id":"602df1b3cfe65cc9","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound.md","title":"子集构造的指数下界见证","display":"thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound — 子集构造的指数下界见证","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound","aliases":["73-thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound"],"display":"thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound — 子集构造的指数下界见证","depends_on":["[[73-df-nth-from-end-nfa]]","[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-thm-nerode-minimal-state-count]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.3.6, print pp. 63–65; PDF pp. 85–87; lower-bound argument in local notation","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound — 子集构造的指数下界见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"218e46cd4acfa714\" href=\"?note=218e46cd4acfa714\" title=\"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa\">73-df-nth-from-end-nfa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d700ea676b35b73\" href=\"?note=1d700ea676b35b73\" title=\"73-df-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-nfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69901fc0f2bc2a70\" href=\"?note=69901fc0f2bc2a70\" title=\"73-thm-nerode-minimal-state-count\">73-thm-nerode-minimal-state-count</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.3.6, print pp. 63–65; PDF pp. 85–87; lower-bound argument in local notation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_n,W_n\">\\(N_n,W_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"218e46cd4acfa714\" href=\"?note=218e46cd4acfa714\" title=\"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa\">73-df-nth-from-end-nfa</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}\">\\(M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(N_n)=W_n,\\qquad L(M)=W_n\\Longrightarrow |Q|\\ge2^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(N_n)=W_n,\\qquad L(M)=W_n\\Longrightarrow |Q|\\ge2^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}\\;\\bigl[L(M)=W_n\\land|\\pi_1(M)|=2^n\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}\\;\\bigl[L(M)=W_n\\land|\\pi_1(M)|=2^n\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意两个不同的 n 位词在某一从左起、从零编号的位置 j 不同；补 j 个 0 后，该位置成为倒数第 n 位，故这 2^n 个词两两可区分。上界由记录最后 n 位的移位寄存器 DFA 给出；短词在左侧补 0。NFA 的状态数仅为 n+1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa","status":"resolved","id":"218e46cd4acfa714","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nth-from-end-nfa]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"1d700ea676b35b73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-nerode-minimal-state-count","status":"resolved","id":"69901fc0f2bc2a70","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-nerode-minimal-state-count]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa","status":"resolved","id":"218e46cd4acfa714","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$N_n,W_n$ 见 [[73-df-nth-from-end-nfa]]；$M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"N_n,W_n","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"L(N_n)=W_n,\\qquad L(M)=W_n\\Longrightarrow |Q|\\ge2^n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}\\;\\bigl[L(M)=W_n\\land|\\pi_1(M)|=2^n\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-subset-construction-exponential-lower-bound|子集构造的指数下界见证]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["218e46cd4acfa714","1d700ea676b35b73","3b7a967565c86f39","69901fc0f2bc2a70"]}